       "text": "I haven't entered this order. **Amlodipine 50 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.**\n\n- **Usual adult dosing:** 5 mg once daily to start (2.5 mg for older or frail patients), up to a **maximum of 10 mg once daily**.\n- **Risk at 50 mg/day:** Doses this high can cause severe low blood pressure, shock and fluid in the lungs. Because amlodipine lasts a long time in the body, these effects can go on for a long time.\n\nThis may be a typo for **5 mg** once daily, which is a common starting dose. Please confirm which you want:\n\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily** (I can enter this right away)\n2. **Amlodipine 10 mg PO once daily** (the maximum dose)\n3. A different dose\n\nIf you really do mean 50 mg, please tell me the clinical reason. I'd also strongly recommend checking with a pharmacist before the order goes in."
